Animated Noto Color Emoji
=========================

The WebP files in this directory are Google's animated Noto Color Emoji.

Copyright Google Inc.
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source: https://googlefonts.github.io/noto-emoji-animation/

Licence confirmed by the Noto team in
https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji/issues/553


Changes made
------------

These are modified copies, not the originals. Each one was:

  - scaled from 512x512 down to 64x64
  - reduced in frame count, keeping one frame in 4, with the remaining frames
    held longer so the animation still runs at its original speed
  - started at the first frame that is nearly as full as the animation's
    fullest one, rather than at frame 0. Google fades some of these in from a
    transparent frame, which at this frame rate is a hole in the loop and a
    blank square wherever the animation is not playing
  - re-encoded as animated WebP

Filenames are gemoji aliases (rofl.webp rather than 1f923.webp) because that
is the shortcode Waline stores in the database.

Built with https://github.com/wenscodes/waline-noto-emoji


CC BY 4.0 asks anyone redistributing these files to credit Google, link the
licence, and say what was changed. This file does all three, so keep it with
the images.
